    "ts": "2026-08-05T20:35:44+00:00",
    "headline": "Paycom’s (NYSE:PAYC) Q2 CY2026: Strong Sales, Stock Soars",
    "summary": "HR software provider Paycom (NYSE:PAYC) reported Q2 CY2026 results topping the market’s revenue expectations, with sales up 9.8% year on year to $531.2 million. The company’s full-year revenue guidance of $2.20 billion at the midpoint came in 0.7% above analysts’ estimates. Its non-GAAP profit of $2.78 per share was 16.8% above analysts’ consensus estimates.",
